{"event": "turn", "session_id": "731187b36e854ae8910bfa22ebd4bf48", "sequence": 2, "created_at": "2026-10-16T07:29:59.726646+00:00", "message": "介绍白茶", "resolved_question": "介绍白茶", "context_turns": 1, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 13.639, "model_calls": 3, "input_tokens": 6258, "output_tokens": 708, "response": {"answer": "**白茶简介**\n\n根据 ISO 20715:2023《茶 — 茶类分类》，白茶是指采摘的茶芽经**萎凋和干燥**两个阶段加工而成的茶。这里的“白茶”指的是山茶属（Camellia sinensis）的一种茶类及其加工方式，而不是用白色花朵或草本植物泡制的饮品。（来源：ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types）\n\n**几点补充说明：**\n\n- **茶类与品种不同**：白茶是加工产品类型，与“品种”（cultivar）是两个概念。同一品种用不同加工方式可制成不同茶类，因此品种本身并不决定成品是白茶还是其他茶。（来源：Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves）\n- **产品描述可包含多个维度**：一款茶的实际描述可结合加工类型、品种、产地、工艺风格、等级、添加配料、产品形态等，这些属性回答的是不同问题，不宜简单合并为一个茶类标签。（来源：Typology of Processed Tea）\n\n**关于风味、用途等**：本次未检索到可验证的白茶风味、冲泡用途等具体属性证据，因此无法提供相关说明，请以具体商品页面标注为准。\n\n如需我按白茶分类为您推荐在售商品，请告诉我您的偏好（如价格区间、包装形式等）。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "rules", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Typology of Processed Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/zh/records/68cbbca2f61e5b80b5e93a95", "year": null}, {"title": "Impact of Six Typical Processing Methods on the Chemical Composition of Tea Leaves", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/en/records/65dff5d763b8185d9cb04493", "year": null}, {"title": "Culture of Çay (tea), UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage", "url": "https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/culture-of-cay-tea-a-symbol-of-identity-hospitality-and-social-interaction-01685?RL=01685", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status":